46    write(11, "The skill loaded and ran the documented workflow against the sample screen. Here is the review output it produced:\n\n## iOS Screen Review \342\200\224 \"Task Detail\" (sample-screen.md)\n\n### High\n- **Destructive action not separated.** \"Delete Task\" shares the same blue style as \"Mark Complete\" and \"Share,\" sitting adjacent to the primary action. *Fix:* give Delete a destructive role (red/text-only, isolated from the primary). *Impact:* prevents accidental data loss.\n- **Touch targets below minimum.** Buttons are 30pt tall and the gear icon is unlabeled. *Fix:* raise to \342\211\24544\303\22744pt and add an accessibility label to the gear. *Impact:* meets HIG accessibility, fewer mis-taps.\n- **Missing states.** Only a default state exists \342\200\224 no loading, empty, error, or offline. *Fix:* define each (spinner, retry on error, offline messaging). *Impact:* avoids dead-ends on failure.\n\n### Medium\n- **No clear visual hierarchy.** Three buttons in identical styling give the primary action no prominence. *Fix:* filled primary for \"Mark Complete,\" secondary/tertiary styles for the rest.\n- **Inconsistent spacing rhythm** (8/20/5pt). *Fix:* adopt a consistent scale (e.g., 8/16/24pt). *Impact:* cleaner, more scannable layout.\n\n### Low\n- **Title too long/redundant.** \"Task Detail Screen View\" repeats \"Screen/View.\" *Fix:* shorten to \"Task Detail.\"\n- **Error copy is a placeholder** (`dummy-id` / `test@example.com`). *Fix:* replace with actionable recovery text.\n\n### Quick wins\n- Shorten the title, add the gear label, and recolor Delete \342\200\224 all low-effort, high-impact.\n\nThe skill executed end to end. Now the execution summary.\n\n## Execution Summary\n\nThe `ios-screen-review` skill is **documentation-only**: a `SKILL.md` plus a `references/review-checklist.md`. It contains no scripts, executables, setup steps, network calls, credentials, or environment dependencies. There was nothing to install, no dry-run/version/status command, and no external service \342\200\224 the entire skill is guidance text. I verified this "..., 4380) = 4380
